# Syntax: docs/LANGUAGE.md. Check with `rbb bid check`.

module choice-of-games "Choosing between 3NT and a major-suit game"
  needs  notrump-base

# Partner has bid 3NT offering a choice (after Stayman, or with five cards
# in a major after a transfer). Correct to four of a major with an
# eight-card fit, which is four opposite four or three opposite five.
when asked choice
  4H  "Corrects to the heart fit"   shows H>=8-partner.H.min  when partner.H>=4
  4S  "Corrects to the spade fit"   shows S>=8-partner.S.min  when partner.S>=4
  P   "Plays 3NT"
